  "subtitle": "Nigerian spiced grilled beef skewers",
  "excerpt": "Suya is thinly sliced beef coated in a dry peanut spice blend and grilled over high heat until charred at the edges. Sold by street vendors across northern Nigeria, it is served with raw onion and tomato. Serves 4.",
